      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, margin",
          "value": "<p>I cannot describe to you the mess in which I am mired. At this moment, my dear brother, I urge you to help me in this matter and to dispatch to me what [is needed,] as I am mired in it\u2014I am mired in debt in a city in distress.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
